1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
More than 13 million people have been forced from their homes in Sudan.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:08,720
The UN warns that areas near Khartoum face famine as war blocks access to aid.

3
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:12,880
In North Darfur, hospitals are overwhelmed or non-operational.

4
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,280
Doctors are leaving due to safety concerns.

5
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:16,720
Medicine is scarce.

6
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:19,840
But SAPA is still working, running mobile clinics,

7
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:22,480
distributing food and restoring water wells.

8
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:27,680
In the face of collapse, we are keeping many alive, one patient, one family at a time.

9
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:30,880
Your support means clean water, critical care,

10
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,520
and warm meals for those who need it the most.

11
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:34,960
Hope never ends.

12
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,160
Act now.

